    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did everything right. i spoke up about the fraud at the firm bc i couldn't just sit there and watch it happen. and now? i've lost everything. no job, no one will hire me in this industry anymore, and even my old friends won't call me back because they're scared of being associated with a \"troublemaker.\" i feel like i traded my entire life for nothing. it's just... empty now.",
