      "content": "It is completely understandable that platitudes about \"resilience\" feel dismissive when you are facing such profound hardship. What you are experiencing is not just a setback; it is a crisis of identity and belonging. Instead of forcing yourself to \"move on,\" perhaps focus on small, tangible acts of self-care that validate your worth outside of your previous professional role. You are not alone in recognizing systemic corruption, and your moral stance holds inherent value even when the world around you fails to see it.",
